WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:06.072
Ally intended to start working right away.

2
00:00:06.073 --> 00:00:10.771
But after she stepped into escape pod Alpha , she quickly got

3
00:00:10.772 --> 00:00:14.333
distracted. "I haven't been in this pod in so

4
00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:18.833
long!" It had a comfortable sleeping unit, along with some fun entertainment

5
00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:23.960
options. But when she looked at the meal-o-matic that dispensed food, she saw it was nearly

