56
00:04:42.265 --> 00:04:46.221
She gasped as she heard the escape pod's engine sparked to life.

57
00:04:46.222 --> 00:04:53.057
Then— whoosh! The pod started to zoom away from the mother

58
00:04:53.058 --> 00:05:00.000
ship. "Alpha!" Ally shouted. "Stop this thing! Get me back to my parents'

59
00:05:00.001 --> 00:05:05.407
ship—fast!" "Unable to comply. Escape pod is unable to redock with the mother ship at this time."

60
00:05:05.408 --> 00:05:09.217
"What?" Ally blinked, trying to understand what she was hearing.

61
00:05:09.218 --> 00:05:12.600
"Then call my parents so I can ask them what to do!"

62
00:05:12.601 --> 00:05:17.480
"Command does not compute. Communication device is offline."

63
00:05:17.481 --> 00:05:28.914
"Oh no!" Ally cried, watching in horror as the pod hurtled into deep space.

